OL,9,G0300 1Xtra's R&B Show with Chuckie
OL,10,     FChuckie dives into his favourite
OL,11,     FUK musical pioneer Sade. Tapping
OL,12,     Finto her catalogue, Chuckie dives
OL,13,     Finto the music that has shaped
OL,14,     FSade and the musical scene we
OL,15,     Fexist in today.
